  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.spine.desc": "From waking up hungry to four walls and a bowl of Krave.",
  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.village.title": "The Village",
  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.village.desc": "A roof over Rule #1, and everything that goes under it.",
  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.kosmos.title": "The Krave Kosmos",
  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.kosmos.desc": "Through the door, into the chocolate.",
  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.bosses.title": "The Bosses",
  "quest.barbarajones.chapter.bosses.desc": "The Monster, the Mom, the Manager and the Plug.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.wake_up.title": "The Craving",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.wake_up.objective": "Wake up. There is a box of something brown in the cupboard and a boy outside who will not stop talking about it. Press K at any time to open this Atlas.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.wake_up.lore": "Rule #1: Cayden Cobb must not die.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.touch_grass.title": "Touch Grass",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.touch_grass.objective": "Shear grass or ferns and craft three HANDFULS OF GRASS. Barbara pulls hers straight out of the ground, so you may as well learn how.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.touch_grass.lore": "She smokes it. Out of the ground. Nobody has ever successfully stopped her.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.the_knife.title": "Mise en Place",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.the_knife.objective": "Craft a GRASS KNIFE, then dice grass with it twice. Fair warning: the knife goes into the recipe and does not come back. Craft a second one, or take the spare this quest hands you.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.the_knife.lore": "The old quest book asked you to be holding the knife AND the diced grass at the same time. It never noticed the recipe eats the knife. That quest could not be completed. Ever.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.the_cereal.title": "The Cereal",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.the_cereal.objective": "Craft 4x KRAVE CEREAL - two wheat, one sugar, one cocoa bean - and pour a KRAVE MILK.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.the_cereal.lore": "Chocolate on the outside. Chocolate on the inside. There is no third layer.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.first_bowl.title": "The First Bowl",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.first_bowl.objective": "Craft a CEREAL BOWL: an empty bowl, Krave, and Krave Milk. The compass this hands you always points at Cayden.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.first_bowl.lore": "You will want to know where he is at all times. See Rule #1.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.first_house.title": "Four Walls",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.first_house.objective": "Build somewhere to live: lay 3 SHAG CARPET and set down a STASH BOX.",
  "quest.barbarajones.spine.first_house.lore": "It is not much. It has a carpet. It counts.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.roof.title": "A Roof Over Rule #1",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.roof.objective": "Get Cayden a real room - enclosed, lit, and tall enough to stand up in - until the village reads tier 2. The HOUSING QUERY tool tells you exactly what is wrong with it.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.roof.lore": "Rule #1 is considerably easier to keep indoors.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.feed.title": "Provider",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.feed.objective": "Feed Cayden 10 times. Krave, nuggets, Pibb - he is not fussy, he is just permanently hungry.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.feed.lore": "He gets wider. That is a feature.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.workshop.title": "Walls and Shelves",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.workshop.objective": "Put up 8 WOOD PANELING and push the village to tier 3.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.workshop.lore": "Dark oak and brown dye. Very 1974.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.living_room.title": "The Living Room",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.living_room.objective": "Set down a TELEVISION and a RECLINER, and push the village to tier 4.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.living_room.lore": "Cayden will find the recliner within about four seconds.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.the_stash.title": "The Stash",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.the_stash.objective": "Place a KRAFTING BENCH and push the village to tier 5. Somebody has been keeping five hundred dollars behind the panelling.",
  "quest.barbarajones.village.the_stash.lore": "Do not ask whose money it was. You are going to spend it anyway.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.the_door.title": "The Door",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.the_door.objective": "Craft and place a KRAVE DOOR - obsidian, amethyst, and a genuinely terrible idea.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.the_door.lore": "It hums. Doors are not supposed to hum.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.arrival.title": "Arrival",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.arrival.objective": "Step through into the KRAVE KOSMOS.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.arrival.lore": "It is warm. That is the worst part.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.kravelings.title": "Kravelings",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.kravelings.objective": "Kill 8 KRAVE MINIONS. They only exist on the far side of the door, so this is not something you can grind out at home.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.kravelings.lore": "Little ones. Teeth all the way round.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.deep_krave.title": "Deep Krave",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.deep_krave.objective": "Grind 24 KRAVE DUST out of cereal and reach Krave level 8.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.deep_krave.lore": "Every bowl you have ever eaten, powdered.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.kosmonaut.title": "Certified Kosmonaut",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.kosmonaut.objective": "Both halves of the Kosmos handled. Nothing left to do here but take the schematic and go home.",
  "quest.barbarajones.kosmos.kosmonaut.lore": "Nobody is impressed. You are a little impressed.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_monster.title": "The Summoning",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_monster.objective": "Craft a KRAVE BOX, right-click it on open ground, and put the KRAVE MONSTER down. Barbara and Cayden fight at your side.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_monster.lore": "He teleports between blinks. Hit him on the way back.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_deal.title": "What $500 Buys",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_deal.objective": "Hand over MOM'S $500. Yes, all of it. Yes, you will regret it.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_deal.lore": "The Atlas takes the money out of your bag when you press the button, and only then. It will never quietly require you to be carrying something.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.mom.title": "Mom Cobb",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.mom.objective": "She heard about the money. Defeat MOM COBB.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.mom.lore": "The belt is memorabilia. She has another one.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_plug.title": "Got That Mothafucker",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_plug.objective": "The Plug scammed you and then shot at you from three hundred blocks. Defeat THE PLUG.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_plug.lore": "Watch for the tracer.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_manager.title": "The Manager",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_manager.objective": "Somebody has to answer for the off-brand cereal. Defeat THE MANAGER.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.the_manager.lore": "He has been employee of the month eleven times running. Unopposed.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.peace.title": "Peace at Last",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.peace.objective": "Every boss down, the village standing, and the kid still breathing. Rule #1 held.",
  "quest.barbarajones.bosses.peace.lore": "The death stages, of course, remain. Forever.",
